  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "937f26b5-ecc6-49c6-a860-ce5b80c9c2dd",
      "title": "Escute e observe como a reclamação abre com um fato específico e facil de verificar.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c15547d2-9373-417d-9735-3b1068cc4be2",
          "textContent": "<p>Primeiro, a reclamacao abre com o fato concreto.</p><p><strong>El producto dejó de funcionar a los dos días de uso.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>O produto parou de funcionar depois de dois dias de uso.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1857d9d86f3e4e959231f8a47731d142_b01-complaint-counter.png?Expires=1794099739&Signature=OqYrahoVAc9oOG6INEhCCCOwgxh0LwAsJfV1v24zYFJvXMDOP0luNQAZQfvd75yg0P9MomAkaBUeOE7XosGuGddPxwwaE8QzgkV91Kpw3IAlIEsQvPAR4LCNop9CeNRwqKQDe-qRukT9qA0jouzGRvZHZsjTQ~7RoFektOdGrbEGK0-LZ9fs1AbR15Ihxap1OyvJ4bmktr597782YGWFsaRMSYFqnsIBQ60WBxb~x8mwZZ2OGnvu4a3R8kVL-cWs0tOIS70nMUP2pyCdqbnFtZnoM1migFVkzVK0hJCXjZypJ9zp6g6ghGFaPIKp5m2Kljddc6ipKHzR2bJDc0U1mg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d7362cfb72c3470583c38f13287d06f3_b01-el-producto-dejo-de-funcionar.mp3?Expires=1794099739&Signature=cm-SrbgnvmA-3NzvVY5sAGaeAUsX0JDi3MmD8KRpw4beUblRgolne7emgyD-MOO9BmFH8FfDcNMhIelJsNxLuXJAme9WKU3oiqFk1AD4MPJS9Ts03Og36kJfPEZdmAEtZqh6~fnDaefjekEwWH7cTPgZM~FYXiZLcHRw5n58zvTvi~RhcwsN3AniLQInTdN-sTvRMnJZ7caft14b5uViHCmQOVsACk5wXgrGxAz32U3yJDXKhDiOFy4vQih-GjQM0TdhBl0SxiQPUQUzE-iZ~L9m5IOwC4HD4EjkMXGN1gPnHZruNx6NQSyRs5m86WuCw-~fdRF018ek35JWNMPKXw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
